# ── personal data ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repo is PUBLIC. Everything tracked here is world-readable forever, even
# after a later delete — GitHub keeps orphaned objects and forks/caches persist.
#
# DATA-NEEDED.md is the content worksheet. Once filled it holds real name,
# location, email, employers, and dates in one tidy file. It stays local.
DATA-NEEDED.md

# Uncomment if you'd rather not publish the product/strategy notes either.
# They currently contain no personal data, so publishing them is safe.
# PRODUCT.md
# .impeccable/surfaces/

# ── agent tooling (local installs, not part of the site) ─────────────────────
.claude/
.agents/
.codex/
.cursor/
.gemini/

# Impeccable local state. DESIGN.md's sidecar and the surface brief ARE kept —
# they are the design system future sessions read.
.impeccable/config.local.json
.impeccable/hook.cache.json
.impeccable/mocks/
.impeccable/sketches/
.impeccable/live/

# ── working files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The pinned design reference. 1.5 MB and not needed to serve the site.
inspiration.png

# Portrait source. assets/img/portrait.webp is the cropped, served copy; the
# full-resolution original is a working file and stays local.
my_photo.jpg

